msgid "Quarkus extension for Spring Transaction API"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"While users are encouraged to use Jakarta `@Transactional` annotations "
"directly, Quarkus provides a compatibility layer for Spring `@Transactional` "
"in the form of the `spring-tx` extension."
msgstr ""

